{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0030_0020", "id": null, "offset": 94, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "案二師口義云, 吳越王遣使, 以五十種寶, 往高麗求敎文, 其國令諦觀來奉諸部, 而智論疏, 仁王疏, 華嚴骨目, 五百門等, 不復至, 據此則知, 海外兩國, 皆曾遣使, 若論敎文復還中國之寶, 則必以高麗 諦觀來奉敎卷爲正", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0030_0030", "id": null, "offset": 38, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "後唐明宗 天成二年, 丁亥歲生", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0030_0030", "id": null, "offset": 109, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "師於天福末, 方十六七, 正受具學華嚴之時來中國, 應在二十後, 以歷推之, 當在漢 周之際, 今言天福恐誤", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0030_0030", "id": null, "offset": 117, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "韶國師所居", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0030_0030", "id": null, "offset": 234, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "忠懿王俶之子", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0030_0030", "id": null, "offset": 300, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 5, "text": "孟子, 行或使之, 止或尼之, 尼語乙反", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0030_0030", "id": null, "offset": 322, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 6, "text": "高麗別名", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0030_0030", "id": null, "offset": 349, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 7, "text": "本朝太祖", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0030_0030", "id": null, "offset": 394, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 8, "text": "師年五十三, 法智年二十", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0030_0030", "id": null, "offset": 444, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 9, "text": "師年五十八, 慈雲二十二", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0030_0030", "id": null, "offset": 559, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 10, "text": "育王未爲禪時, 其徒嘗請寶雲諸師, 屢建講席, 寶雲旣終, 因葬骨於此地", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0030_0030", "id": null, "offset": 572, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 11, "text": "英宗", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0030_0030", "id": null, "offset": 612, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 12, "text": "徽宗", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0030_0030", "id": null, "offset": 702, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 13, "text": "見振祖集石塔記", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0030_0030", "id": null, "offset": 862, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 14, "text": "觝音抵觸也", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0030_0030", "id": null, "offset": 962, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 15, "text": "繹音亦抽絲也", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0030_0040", "id": null, "offset": 19, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "太宗", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0030_0040", "id": null, "offset": 27, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "時年二十", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0030_0040", "id": null, "offset": 152, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "擐音患亦貫也", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0030_0040", "id": null, "offset": 186, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "慈雲, 撰指要鈔序, 采用法智自解之說也", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0040_0010", "id": null, "offset": 12, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "二世", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0040_0010", "id": null, "offset": 32, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "三世", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0040_0010", "id": null, "offset": 41, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "此下四人嗣光師", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0040_0010", "id": null, "offset": 74, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "見善師傳", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0040_0020", "id": null, "offset": 110, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "詩, 螟蛉有子, 蜾蠃負之, 敎誨爾子, 式穀似之, 楊子, 螟蛉之子, 壹而逢蜾蠃, 祝之曰, 類我類我, 螟蛉桑上靑虫, 蜾蠃細腰蜂", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0040_0020", "id": null, "offset": 324, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "天親, 上生兜率一遶彌勒座下, 報無著已六月矣. 此言天境時分常長, 今光師龍宮七日說法, 回至海船始半日耳. 此蓋龍宮晝夜常短之驗, 或欲以比地涌品六十小劫謂如食頃者. 據疏記, 六十非虛佛威所加, 忘其爲久, 則知今龍宮旣非佛國, 又非佛加, 應以龍宮自謂七日, 船人自謂半日, 各執情謂以之爲實, 如荊溪謂六十食頃, 但是情謂非實短也", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0040_0020", "id": null, "offset": 380, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "文句, 受記亦云受莂, 受是得義, 莂是別了", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0050_0010", "id": null, "offset": 29, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "三世", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0060_0010", "id": null, "offset": 19, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "下三人左溪紀", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0060_0020", "id": null, "offset": 12, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "三世", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0060_0030", "id": null, "offset": 12, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "二世", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0060_0030", "id": null, "offset": 35, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "四明", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0060_0030", "id": null, "offset": 43, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "四明與矩師書", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0060_0030", "id": null, "offset": 51, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "錢唐", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0060_0030", "id": null, "offset": 59, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 5, "text": "四明本紀", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0060_0040", "id": null, "offset": 94, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "妙玄旣散失不存, 未審何緣知之, 必寂師先曾見殘編耳", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0090_0010", "id": null, "offset": 78, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "今東壽昌", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0120_0010", "id": null, "offset": 17, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "亡, 今東山有板, 二卷是海東復還者", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0120_0020", "id": null, "offset": 31, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "石芝云, 四明承用其義於妙宗鈔中, 故無可傳之文", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0120_0020", "id": null, "offset": 44, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "指南云, 請尋寶雲 備急鈔", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0120_0030", "id": null, "offset": 7, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "觀師", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0120_0030", "id": null, "offset": 11, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "一卷依章安 八敎大意刪補", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0130_0010", "id": null, "offset": 17, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "永壽", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0160_0010", "id": null, "offset": 27, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "志磐撰齋忌疏", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0180_0010", "id": null, "offset": 26, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "與新羅·百濟爲三國", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0200_0020", "id": null, "offset": 103, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "今山側有新羅將", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0200_0020", "id": null, "offset": 149, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "草菴錄", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0210_0010", "id": null, "offset": 125, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "吳越王傳", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0210_0030", "id": null, "offset": 28, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "丁幺切", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0230_0020", "id": null, "offset": 24, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "當云荊溪傳邃, 邃傳修", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0230_0030", "id": null, "offset": 33, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "寂師", "type": "원주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_jipseong-ko_066_ko_066_0230_0030", "id": null, "offset": 39, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "錢 忠懿王", "type": "원주"}
